const spec=[
['Enclosure W × H × D','483 × 109 × 363 mm','Cabinet and feet, excluding cables/PC. Governs scene scale; connector locations estimated.','33'],
['Analog inputs','8 single-ended; >1 MΩ DC','All active channels share sampling times; model assumes ideal source, negligible loading.','34'],
['Resolution and input span','16 bit; −10 through +10 V','Fixed hardware span; 305.17578125 µV per nominal code step.','34'],
['Acquisition clock','1 Hz–500 kHz per channel','Documented range. Model assumes exact, synchronized clocks; cap of 250,000 values per record.','34'],
['Host and digital connectors','USB 2 Type B; DB25; 4 telegraph BNCs','Rear layout per guide. USB availability gates readiness; digital I/O and telegraph conversion not simulated.','19'],
